{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.layer-biological","title":"Biological Layer of Mental Health","description":"Kaitan antara kesehatan fisik, fungsi otak, dan reaktivitas emosional.","tags":["psychology","biology","health"],"custom":{"description":"Kaitan antara kesehatan fisik, fungsi otak, dan reaktivitas emosional."},"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-biological","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"503a7fd80f41696390d12faf91cac264","updated":1782198659042,"created":1782198659042,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-biological","id":"notes.psychology.layer-biological","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-biological","id":"notes.psychology.layer-biological","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.biology","alias":"biology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.biology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-biological","id":"notes.psychology.layer-biological","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.health","alias":"health","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.health"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.layer-biological","id":"notes.psychology.layer-biological","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":11,"offset":1256},"end":{"line":21,"column":76,"offset":1321},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework"}}],"anchors":{"biological-layer-of-mental-health":{"type":"header","text":"Biological Layer of Mental Health","value":"biological-layer-of-mental-health","line":13,"column":0,"depth":1},"the-brain-as-an-organ":{"type":"header","text":"The Brain as an Organ","value":"the-brain-as-an-organ","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"key-biological-stressors":{"type":"header","text":"Key Biological Stressors","value":"key-biological-stressors","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-body-mind-axis":{"type":"header","text":"The Body-Mind Axis","value":"the-body-mind-axis","line":24,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"biological-layer-of-mental-health\">Biological Layer of Mental Health<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#biological-layer-of-mental-health\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"biological-layer-of-mental-health-1\">Biological Layer of Mental Health<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#biological-layer-of-mental-health-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"the-brain-as-an-organ\">The Brain as an Organ<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-brain-as-an-organ\"></a></h2>\n<p>Kesehatan jiwa sangat bergantung pada kondisi biologis karena otak adalah organ fisik. Kapasitas kita untuk tidak reaktif dan tetap stabil secara emosional ditentukan oleh kondisi tubuh.</p>\n<h2 id=\"key-biological-stressors\">Key Biological Stressors<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#key-biological-stressors\"></a></h2>\n<p>Beberapa faktor fisik yang dapat memperburuk kondisi psikologis:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Sedentary Behavior</strong>: Terlalu banyak duduk dan kurang gerak dapat memicu inflamasi otak yang berkontribusi pada gambaran depresif.</li>\n<li><strong>Over-stimulation</strong>: Paparan gadget berlebih dan <em>doomscrolling</em> membuat sistem saraf terus-menerus dalam kondisi waspada/stres.</li>\n<li><strong>Poor Lifestyle</strong>: Kurang tidur, gizi buruk, dan polusi lingkungan menurunkan ambang batas toleransi terhadap stres.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"the-body-mind-axis\">The Body-Mind Axis<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-body-mind-axis\"></a></h2>\n<p>Stres kronik tidak hanya ada di pikiran, tapi bermanifestasi secara fisik:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Brain-Gut Axis</strong>: Masalah lambung, konstipasi, atau diare akibat stres.</li>\n<li><strong>Brain-Skin Axis</strong>: Jerawat atau rambut rontok akibat stres kronik.</li>\n<li><strong>Dopamine Loops</strong>: Perilaku adiktif (belanja online, PMO, merokok) sebagai upaya instan menaikkan dopamin saat sistem saraf lelah.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Tubuh yang lelah membuat suara internal defensif (seperti \"cie sok peduli\") menjadi lebih keras dan sulit dilawan.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework\">Biopsychosocial-Cultural-Spiritual Framework</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">biology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">health (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFor